Welcome to the '''Mether Wiki'''! Mether is a large-scale Minecraft Fabric dimension mod by '''menear''' that adds an entire crystal dimension, 10 crystal types across 4 equipment tiers, 8 custom biomes, new mobs and bosses, and a full progression system. This wiki is an encyclopedia written by fans for fans — anyone can edit!

==How to get to the Mether==
The Mether is a separate dimension that you can reach with a '''[[Luminite Portal]]''':

# Mine '''luminite ore''' (found in the Overworld as a rare deepstone ore) and smelt the shards into '''refined luminite''', or combine 9 luminite shards into a '''luminite block'''.
# Craft '''crystal stone''' from the Mod's stone and build the '''luminite portal frame''' (recipe: luminite blocks + crystal stone).
# Light the frame to activate the '''Mether portal''' - stepping through it teleports you to the Mether dimension. Touching the portal again (or a portal built back home) returns you to the Overworld.
# Bring a '''teleportation crystal''' for emergency travel back to your spawn point.

