Every crystal tier includes a full '''pickaxe, axe, shovel, hoe, sword''', and a '''helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots''' armor set. Tools repair with refined crystals, armor repairs with refined crystals too. Higher tiers have knockback resistance (Tier 3: 0.1, Tier 4: 0.2).

