===Bosses (planned / files included)===
The mod ships 6 additional boss classes with loot tables, planned for future updates:
[[Frost Crystal Leviathan]], [[Verdant Crystal Hydra]], [[Storm Crystal Dragon]], [[Infernal Crystal Titan]], [[Void Crystal Serpent]], [[Prismatic Overlord]].

Each tier-2+ boss is designed to drop that crystal's '''Boss Core'''.

==Progression & Advancements==
The mod includes 5 advancements:
* '''Root''' - start your journey into Mether
* '''Crystal Collector''' - gather every crystal type
* '''Luminarch Defeat''' - defeat the Luminarch boss
* '''Prismatic Gear''' - craft full prismarite equipment
* '''All Bosses Defeated''' - triumph over every boss

==Crafting Stations (upcoming)==
The '''Crystal Forge''' and '''Crystal Infuser''' blocks exist with container inventories, but their graphical interfaces are still in development for this alpha version.

==Soundtrack & Audio==
Custom synthesized sounds are included for:
* Portal activation, ambient, and travel
* Crystal block place/break/step/hit/fall
* Crystal item equip and pickup
* Every mob's ambient/hurt/death sounds (plus crystal mage cast and elemental explode)
* The Luminarch's attack and roar
* Music for Crystal Plains, Crystal Forest, and the Luminarch boss fight

