==About==
'''Mether ''' is a Minecraft '''Fabric''' dimension mod that adds a complete crystal-themed dimension with:
* 10 crystals / 4 tiers
* 8 custom biomes
* 7+ hostile & passive mobs and 7 boss designs
* Full tool & armor sets
* Custom sounds, music, and advancement tree

Web: [https://github.com/menearmenear/mether GitHub]
